# PRIVACY: the entire me/ directory is excluded from git.
# It contains the resume PDF (with email + phone) and personal reference material
# that must NEVER be pushed to a public repo.  The portrait used by the site lives
# in shared/assets/portrait.jpg, which IS committed and bundled into builds.
me/
